## Repository Structure

```
SleepAway/
├── dashboard/
│   ├── sleepaway_detection.py      # Main fatigue detection (MediaPipe + EAR)
│   └── gps_test.py                 # GPS NMEA parsing test
├── headband/
│   └── imu_calibration.ino         # ESP32 IMU reading + calibration
├── hardware/
│   └── circuit_diagrams/           # LaTeX circuit diagrams (circuitikz)
├── docs/
│   └── design_report/              # Progress report assets
└── README.md
```

