## Target Specifications

| Requirement | Target |
|---|---|
| Detection accuracy | ≥ 90% regardless of conditions |
| Headband battery life | > 10 hours |
| Main module power | Standard USB-C (5V/3A) |
| Headband weight | < 300g |
| Alert response time | < 1 second after fatigue confirmed |

---
| Model    | Test accuracy | Size |
|----------|---------------|------|
| float32  | 0.9859        | ~300 KB |
| float16  | 0.9857        | ~150 KB |
| dynamic  | 0.9854        | ~90 KB  |
| int8     | 0.5813        | ~50 KB  |

